    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d668">

                <pb facs="1066" n="970" xml:id="pg970"/>

                <head>No. 666.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 30,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>General Pieltain denies that he directed the capture of the Virginius, and
                    asserts that the order was given by the commanding officer of the fleet to take
                    her wherever found.</p>
                <closer><signed>SICKLES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
